      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOP THE LOT (1) has a strong record this journey here with three wins and a minor from five starts. Hit the frame latest (19.08) when third at this track in a Grade 5. Expected to be in the finish. HARA'S JOKER (3) finished well back at Q Lakeside last time when a 8 length seventh (26.05) but recorded best time of the card when winning four back. Has never been out of the money in three starts this course and distance. Has the ability to give this a shake. MAGNIFICENT DROP (6) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 0.8 lengths win at this track in a handy 19.35. Has a tricky draw to overcome but has a good record over this journey. Bold showing expected again. UNCLE JOE (2) placed last time out so worth considering.",
